        & ") vs "
        & [Compare Short]
        & ".</li><li>Staff "
        & FORMAT ( DIVIDE ( [Staff Cost B27] - [Staff Cost Cmp], [Staff Cost Cmp] ), "+0.0%;-0.0%" )
        & ", cost to income "
        & IF ( ISBLANK ( [Cost to Income Cmp] ), "–", FORMAT ( [Cost to Income Cmp], "0.0%" ) )
        & " to <b>"
        & IF ( ISBLANK ( [Cost to Income B27] ), "–", FORMAT ( [Cost to Income B27], "0.0%" ) )
        & "</b>.</li><li>2026: "
        & IF ( ISBLANK ( _prog ), "–", FORMAT ( _prog, "0%" ) )
        & " done by Sep (pace 75%), lands at "
